causal-loop 1

# Finding B1: every spelling below is read by CausalLoopParser today.
# An unquoted label, a quoted identifier, leading whitespace, an unquoted loop
# name, S and O as polarity, and a link's note written as a bare word.

variable a Label
variable "my id" "My id"
  variable indented "Indented"
variable b "B"

link a -> b S
link b -> a O
link "my id" -> a +
link a -> indented + bareNote
  link indented -> a -

loop R1 Unquoted a indented
loop B2 "Through b" a b
